  "account": "文汇书香苑",
  "source_title": "袁隆平 700 株秧苗被一夜拔光，到现在都没人站出来承认 #袁隆平 #中国杂交水稻之父 #国之脊梁 #读书感悟 #读书心得 #读书笔记#读书推荐 #传递正能量",
  "title_is_metadata_not_transcript": true,
  "input_mode": "text_only",
  "status": "AI_PENDING",
  "unit_index": 1,
  "unit_count": 1,
  "all_video_unit_ids": [
    "v_5ab745923f1d56a7_u01"
  ],
  "duration_s": 318.67,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "二零二一年五月二十二号下午，长沙湘雅医院门口来了一波又一波人，有人手里捧着菊花，有人抱着干戈的稻穗，有人什么都没带，就站在那儿抹眼泪。从医院到殡仪馆的路上车停了，喇叭响了，开车的、骑车的、走路的都停下来，目送一个上了年纪的农民把一捆带着泥的稻穗放在医院，路边的在台阶上弯下腰，深深鞠了一躬。那天去世的这位老人叫袁隆平，你可能听过他的名字，知道他是杂交水稻之父，拿过共和国勋章。但我今天不想跟你说，他有多风光，我想把他从领奖台上拽下来，放回那个饿漂遍野，连树皮都被扒光的年代。那是上世纪六十年代，袁隆平还只是湖南安，将农校一个普通老师，月工资四十多块，住在一间漏雨的宿舍里，全国闹饥荒。他亲眼看见路边有人饿的走不动，倒在田埂上就再也没起来。他自己也饿，饿的两条腿肿的发亮，用手指头一按就是一个坑，好半天才能慢慢鼓回来，那是饿出来的浮肿。后来在记者采访时，他讲了一件让人非常痛心的事，说他看见一个母亲抱着孩子，孩子已经没气了，母亲还在往孩子嘴里塞东西。他说，那一刻，他站在田埂上浑身发抖，心里只有一个念头。袁隆平，你这辈子要是不让中国人吃饱饭，你就是个罪人。就是从那天起，他开始跟自己死磕，可你知道当时的科学界怎么看他吗？他们说，水稻是自花授粉植物杂交育种，根本不可能成功。这是写进教科书的定论，是全世界农业科学家的共识。一个小小的农校老师想推翻这个，简直是异想天开。袁隆平偏不信，他说，书本上的结论都是前人做不来，前人做不到，不代表后人做不到。没有实验室没有经费，他就一个人扎进稻田，像个农民一样逐竹竹竹穗的找找什么找那种天然雄性不育珠，也就是不能自我授粉的特殊水稻。水稻只在正午短短几十分钟开花，错过一秒，当天就白费。整整两年，他每天顶着日头最毒的时候，泡在田里脊背，晒得层层脱皮，稻叶滑的满腿都是血口子，眼睛看花花了，看到流泪，看到肿的睁不开，就蹲在泥水里，用手指一朵一朵扒拉着摸着找。整整两年，他硬生生看遍了十四万株稻穗十四万次，低头十四万次失望。最后，偌大的田野里，只找到六株，就是这微不足道的六株小苗，后来推翻了全世界的定论，把亿万中国人从要饿死的边缘拉了回来。可你以为找到这六株就熬出头了，命运从来不会轻易放过一个人。就在他把这六株秧苗小心翼翼培育到七百多株，眼看着希望越来越大的时候出事了。那天清晨，他冲到试验田，整个人都僵住了七百多株秧苗啊，一夜之间被人连根拔光整片田，光秃秃的满地都是脚印，四年的心血，全部的数据，所有的希望一夜归零。四十岁的大男人，蹲在空无一人的田埂上，哭得撕心裂肺，没人道歉，没人追责，没人安慰，所有人都等着看他认输。看他倒下，他没有倒，也没有放弃，疯了一样的四处找，找了整整四天，最后在学校一口废弃的烂水井里，摸到了五株奄奄一息的秧苗，就靠着这五株快要枯死的稻苗，他擦干眼泪，从头再来。嗯，这事到底是谁干的？后来查了，至今也没查出来，干这件事儿的人到今天都没站出来。像这样的事儿他一干就是十几年。这十几年里他经历了什么？中国人的饭碗到底是怎么端牢的？点个关注点个赞。嗯，收藏起来，转发给身边的亲人。评论区留下一句元老，我们记得您让更多人知道这五株秧苗背后的故事。下集我接着讲。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ab745923f1d56a7_s00001",
      "start_ms": 130,
      "end_ms": 3090,
      "text": "二零二一年五月二十二号下午，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ab745923f1d56a7_s00002",
      "start_ms": 3370,
      "end_ms": 6990,
      "text": "长沙湘雅医院门口来了一波又一波人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ab745923f1d56a7_s00003",
      "start_ms": 7530,
      "end_ms": 9130,
      "text": "有人手里捧着菊花，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ab745923f1d56a7_s00004",
      "start_ms": 9390,
      "end_ms": 11230,
      "text": "有人抱着干戈的稻穗，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ab745923f1d56a7_s00005",
      "start_ms": 11490,
      "end_ms": 12730,
      "text": "有人什么都没带，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ab745923f1d56a7_s00006",
      "start_ms": 13210,
      "end_ms": 14930,
      "text": "就站在那儿抹眼泪。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ab745923f1d56a7_s00007",
      "start_ms": 15290,
      "end_ms": 18350,
      "text": "从医院到殡仪馆的路上车停了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ab745923f1d56a7_s00008",
      "start_ms": 18530,
      "end_ms": 19370,
      "text": "喇叭响了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ab745923f1d56a7_s00009",
      "start_ms": 19670,
      "end_ms": 23230,
      "text": "开车的、骑车的、走路的都停下来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ab745923f1d56a7_s00010",
      "start_ms": 23230,
      "end_ms": 29430,
      "text": "目送一个上了年纪的农民把一捆带着泥的稻穗放在医院，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ab745923f1d56a7_s00011",
      "start_ms": 29430,
      "end_ms": 32280,
      "text": "路边的在台阶上弯下腰，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ab745923f1d56a7_s00012",
      "start_ms": 32560,
      "end_ms": 33840,
      "text": "深深鞠了一躬。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ab745923f1d56a7_s00013",
      "start_ms": 33980,
      "end_ms": 37260,
      "text": "那天去世的这位老人叫袁隆平，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ab745923f1d56a7_s00014",
      "start_ms": 38039,
      "end_ms": 39540,
      "text": "你可能听过他的名字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ab745923f1d56a7_s00015",
      "start_ms": 39820,
      "end_ms": 42120,
      "text": "知道他是杂交水稻之父，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ab745923f1d56a7_s00016",
      "start_ms": 42620,
      "end_ms": 43980,
      "text": "拿过共和国勋章。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ab745923f1d56a7_s00017",
      "start_ms": 44520,
      "end_ms": 46080,
      "text": "但我今天不想跟你说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ab745923f1d56a7_s00018",
      "start_ms": 46080,
      "end_ms": 46980,
      "text": "他有多风光，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ab745923f1d56a7_s00019",
      "start_ms": 47620,
      "end_ms": 50280,
      "text": "我想把他从领奖台上拽下来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ab745923f1d56a7_s00020",
      "start_ms": 50640,
      "end_ms": 52260,
      "text": "放回那个饿漂遍野，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ab745923f1d56a7_s00021",
      "start_ms": 52800,
      "end_ms": 55020,
      "text": "连树皮都被扒光的年代。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ab745923f1d56a7_s00022",
      "start_ms": 55920,
      "end_ms": 57600,
      "text": "那是上世纪六十年代，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ab745923f1d56a7_s00023",
      "start_ms": 58140,
      "end_ms": 60010,
      "text": "袁隆平还只是湖南安，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ab745923f1d56a7_s00024",
      "start_ms": 60070,
      "end_ms": 61875,
      "text": "将农校一个普通老师，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ab745923f1d56a7_s00025",
      "start_ms": 62450,
      "end_ms": 64255,
      "text": "月工资四十多块，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ab745923f1d56a7_s00026",
      "start_ms": 65240,
      "end_ms": 67815,
      "text": "住在一间漏雨的宿舍里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ab745923f1d56a7_s00027",
      "start_ms": 68050,
      "end_ms": 69050,
      "text": "全国闹饥荒。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ab745923f1d56a7_s00028",
      "start_ms": 69270,
      "end_ms": 71715,
      "text": "他亲眼看见路边有人饿的走不动，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ab745923f1d56a7_s00029",
      "start_ms": 72040,
      "end_ms": 74135,
      "text": "倒在田埂上就再也没起来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ab745923f1d56a7_s00030",
      "start_ms": 74620,
      "end_ms": 75645,
      "text": "他自己也饿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ab745923f1d56a7_s00031",
      "start_ms": 76210,
      "end_ms": 78205,
      "text": "饿的两条腿肿的发亮，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ab745923f1d56a7_s00032",
      "start_ms": 78880,
      "end_ms": 81265,
      "text": "用手指头一按就是一个坑，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ab745923f1d56a7_s00033",
      "start_ms": 81800,
      "end_ms": 83865,
      "text": "好半天才能慢慢鼓回来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ab745923f1d56a7_s00034",
      "start_ms": 84190,
      "end_ms": 85785,
      "text": "那是饿出来的浮肿。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ab745923f1d56a7_s00035",
      "start_ms": 86640,
      "end_ms": 88205,
      "text": "后来在记者采访时，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ab745923f1d56a7_s00036",
      "start_ms": 88530,
      "end_ms": 90625,
      "text": "他讲了一件让人非常痛心的事，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ab745923f1d56a7_s00037",
      "start_ms": 90930,
      "end_ms": 93155,
      "text": "说他看见一个母亲抱着孩子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ab745923f1d56a7_s00038",
      "start_ms": 93550,
      "end_ms": 94815,
      "text": "孩子已经没气了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ab745923f1d56a7_s00039",
      "start_ms": 95280,
      "end_ms": 97745,
      "text": "母亲还在往孩子嘴里塞东西。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ab745923f1d56a7_s00040",
      "start_ms": 98220,
      "end_ms": 98540,
      "text": "他说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ab745923f1d56a7_s00041",
      "start_ms": 98540,
      "end_ms": 98960,
      "text": "那一刻，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ab745923f1d56a7_s00042",
      "start_ms": 98960,
      "end_ms": 101440,
      "text": "他站在田埂上浑身发抖，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ab745923f1d56a7_s00043",
      "start_ms": 101620,
      "end_ms": 103125,
      "text": "心里只有一个念头。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ab745923f1d56a7_s00044",
      "start_ms": 103580,
      "end_ms": 104195,
      "text": "袁隆平，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ab745923f1d56a7_s00045",
      "start_ms": 104730,
      "end_ms": 107570,
      "text": "你这辈子要是不让中国人吃饱饭，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ab745923f1d56a7_s00046",
      "start_ms": 107870,
      "end_ms": 108985,
      "text": "你就是个罪人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ab745923f1d56a7_s00047",
      "start_ms": 109740,
      "end_ms": 110820,
      "text": "就是从那天起，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ab745923f1d56a7_s00048",
      "start_ms": 111080,
      "end_ms": 112635,
      "text": "他开始跟自己死磕，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ab745923f1d56a7_s00049",
      "start_ms": 113570,
      "end_ms": 115995,
      "text": "可你知道当时的科学界怎么看他吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ab745923f1d56a7_s00050",
      "start_ms": 116560,
      "end_ms": 117060,
      "text": "他们说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ab745923f1d56a7_s00051",
      "start_ms": 117060,
      "end_ms": 121340,
      "text": "水稻是自花授粉植物杂交育种，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ab745923f1d56a7_s00052",
      "start_ms": 121380,
      "end_ms": 122940,
      "text": "根本不可能成功。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ab745923f1d56a7_s00053",
      "start_ms": 123420,
      "end_ms": 125640,
      "text": "这是写进教科书的定论，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ab745923f1d56a7_s00054",
      "start_ms": 126140,
      "end_ms": 128400,
      "text": "是全世界农业科学家的共识。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ab745923f1d56a7_s00055",
      "start_ms": 129020,
      "end_ms": 132520,
      "text": "一个小小的农校老师想推翻这个，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ab745923f1d56a7_s00056",
      "start_ms": 132680,
      "end_ms": 134320,
      "text": "简直是异想天开。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ab745923f1d56a7_s00057",
      "start_ms": 134760,
      "end_ms": 136060,
      "text": "袁隆平偏不信，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ab745923f1d56a7_s00058",
      "start_ms": 136240,
      "end_ms": 136660,
      "text": "他说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ab745923f1d56a7_s00059",
      "start_ms": 136960,
      "end_ms": 139580,
      "text": "书本上的结论都是前人做不来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ab745923f1d56a7_s00060",
      "start_ms": 139920,
      "end_ms": 141080,
      "text": "前人做不到，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ab745923f1d56a7_s00061",
      "start_ms": 141240,
      "end_ms": 142620,
      "text": "不代表后人做不到。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ab745923f1d56a7_s00062",
      "start_ms": 143480,
      "end_ms": 145500,
      "text": "没有实验室没有经费，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ab745923f1d56a7_s00063",
      "start_ms": 145840,
      "end_ms": 147600,
      "text": "他就一个人扎进稻田，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ab745923f1d56a7_s00064",
      "start_ms": 148120,
      "end_ms": 156490,
      "text": "像个农民一样逐竹竹竹穗的找找什么找那种天然雄性不育珠，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ab745923f1d56a7_s00065",
      "start_ms": 156910,
      "end_ms": 160670,
      "text": "也就是不能自我授粉的特殊水稻。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ab745923f1d56a7_s00066",
      "start_ms": 161570,
      "end_ms": 164630,
      "text": "水稻只在正午短短几十分钟开花，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ab745923f1d56a7_s00067",
      "start_ms": 165130,
      "end_ms": 165950,
      "text": "错过一秒，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ab745923f1d56a7_s00068",
      "start_ms": 166129,
      "end_ms": 167250,
      "text": "当天就白费。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ab745923f1d56a7_s00069",
      "start_ms": 168170,
      "end_ms": 169110,
      "text": "整整两年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ab745923f1d56a7_s00070",
      "start_ms": 169390,
      "end_ms": 172170,
      "text": "他每天顶着日头最毒的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ab745923f1d56a7_s00071",
      "start_ms": 172230,
      "end_ms": 174130,
      "text": "泡在田里脊背，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ab745923f1d56a7_s00072",
      "start_ms": 174390,
      "end_ms": 175870,
      "text": "晒得层层脱皮，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ab745923f1d56a7_s00073",
      "start_ms": 176070,
      "end_ms": 178510,
      "text": "稻叶滑的满腿都是血口子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ab745923f1d56a7_s00074",
      "start_ms": 178910,
      "end_ms": 180315,
      "text": "眼睛看花花了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ab745923f1d56a7_s00075",
      "start_ms": 180550,
      "end_ms": 181350,
      "text": "看到流泪，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ab745923f1d56a7_s00076",
      "start_ms": 181690,
      "end_ms": 183190,
      "text": "看到肿的睁不开，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ab745923f1d56a7_s00077",
      "start_ms": 183490,
      "end_ms": 184890,
      "text": "就蹲在泥水里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ab745923f1d56a7_s00078",
      "start_ms": 184890,
      "end_ms": 187585,
      "text": "用手指一朵一朵扒拉着摸着找。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ab745923f1d56a7_s00079",
      "start_ms": 189010,
      "end_ms": 190095,
      "text": "整整两年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ab745923f1d56a7_s00080",
      "start_ms": 190580,
      "end_ms": 195560,
      "text": "他硬生生看遍了十四万株稻穗十四万次，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ab745923f1d56a7_s00081",
      "start_ms": 195560,
      "end_ms": 197575,
      "text": "低头十四万次失望。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ab745923f1d56a7_s00082",
      "start_ms": 198150,
      "end_ms": 198610,
      "text": "最后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ab745923f1d56a7_s00083",
      "start_ms": 198930,
      "end_ms": 200090,
      "text": "偌大的田野里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ab745923f1d56a7_s00084",
      "start_ms": 200090,
      "end_ms": 201245,
      "text": "只找到六株，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ab745923f1d56a7_s00085",
      "start_ms": 201540,
      "end_ms": 204035,
      "text": "就是这微不足道的六株小苗，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ab745923f1d56a7_s00086",
      "start_ms": 204690,
      "end_ms": 207025,
      "text": "后来推翻了全世界的定论，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ab745923f1d56a7_s00087",
      "start_ms": 207380,
      "end_ms": 211035,
      "text": "把亿万中国人从要饿死的边缘拉了回来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ab745923f1d56a7_s00088",
      "start_ms": 211990,
      "end_ms": 215050,
      "text": "可你以为找到这六株就熬出头了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ab745923f1d56a7_s00089",
      "start_ms": 215190,
      "end_ms": 217765,
      "text": "命运从来不会轻易放过一个人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ab745923f1d56a7_s00090",
      "start_ms": 218370,
      "end_ms": 222255,
      "text": "就在他把这六株秧苗小心翼翼培育到七百多株，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ab745923f1d56a7_s00091",
      "start_ms": 222940,
      "end_ms": 226275,
      "text": "眼看着希望越来越大的时候出事了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ab745923f1d56a7_s00092",
      "start_ms": 226890,
      "end_ms": 227870,
      "text": "那天清晨，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ab745923f1d56a7_s00093",
      "start_ms": 227870,
      "end_ms": 229030,
      "text": "他冲到试验田，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ab745923f1d56a7_s00094",
      "start_ms": 229090,
      "end_ms": 232555,
      "text": "整个人都僵住了七百多株秧苗啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ab745923f1d56a7_s00095",
      "start_ms": 232890,
      "end_ms": 236230,
      "text": "一夜之间被人连根拔光整片田，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ab745923f1d56a7_s00096",
      "start_ms": 236330,
      "end_ms": 238695,
      "text": "光秃秃的满地都是脚印，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ab745923f1d56a7_s00097",
      "start_ms": 239340,
      "end_ms": 240505,
      "text": "四年的心血，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ab745923f1d56a7_s00098",
      "start_ms": 240790,
      "end_ms": 241785,
      "text": "全部的数据，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ab745923f1d56a7_s00099",
      "start_ms": 242190,
      "end_ms": 244545,
      "text": "所有的希望一夜归零。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ab745923f1d56a7_s00100",
      "start_ms": 245450,
      "end_ms": 246915,
      "text": "四十岁的大男人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ab745923f1d56a7_s00101",
      "start_ms": 247670,
      "end_ms": 249790,
      "text": "蹲在空无一人的田埂上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ab745923f1d56a7_s00102",
      "start_ms": 249870,
      "end_ms": 251055,
      "text": "哭得撕心裂肺，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ab745923f1d56a7_s00103",
      "start_ms": 251420,
      "end_ms": 252220,
      "text": "没人道歉，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ab745923f1d56a7_s00104",
      "start_ms": 252500,
      "end_ms": 253460,
      "text": "没人追责，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ab745923f1d56a7_s00105",
      "start_ms": 253640,
      "end_ms": 254635,
      "text": "没人安慰，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ab745923f1d56a7_s00106",
      "start_ms": 255200,
      "end_ms": 257245,
      "text": "所有人都等着看他认输。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ab745923f1d56a7_s00107",
      "start_ms": 257550,
      "end_ms": 258405,
      "text": "看他倒下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ab745923f1d56a7_s00108",
      "start_ms": 258790,
      "end_ms": 259470,
      "text": "他没有倒，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ab745923f1d56a7_s00109",
      "start_ms": 259670,
      "end_ms": 260775,
      "text": "也没有放弃，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ab745923f1d56a7_s00110",
      "start_ms": 261110,
      "end_ms": 262525,
      "text": "疯了一样的四处找，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ab745923f1d56a7_s00111",
      "start_ms": 263010,
      "end_ms": 264375,
      "text": "找了整整四天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ab745923f1d56a7_s00112",
      "start_ms": 265000,
      "end_ms": 268345,
      "text": "最后在学校一口废弃的烂水井里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ab745923f1d56a7_s00113",
      "start_ms": 268720,
      "end_ms": 271615,
      "text": "摸到了五株奄奄一息的秧苗，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ab745923f1d56a7_s00114",
      "start_ms": 272120,
      "end_ms": 274600,
      "text": "就靠着这五株快要枯死的稻苗，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ab745923f1d56a7_s00115",
      "start_ms": 275120,
      "end_ms": 276285,
      "text": "他擦干眼泪，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ab745923f1d56a7_s00116",
      "start_ms": 276750,
      "end_ms": 277895,
      "text": "从头再来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ab745923f1d56a7_s00117",
      "start_ms": 278470,
      "end_ms": 278760,
      "text": "嗯，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ab745923f1d56a7_s00118",
      "start_ms": 278970,
      "end_ms": 280615,
      "text": "这事到底是谁干的？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ab745923f1d56a7_s00119",
      "start_ms": 281920,
      "end_ms": 282780,
      "text": "后来查了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ab745923f1d56a7_s00120",
      "start_ms": 282780,
      "end_ms": 284015,
      "text": "至今也没查出来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ab745923f1d56a7_s00121",
      "start_ms": 285230,
      "end_ms": 288255,
      "text": "干这件事儿的人到今天都没站出来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ab745923f1d56a7_s00122",
      "start_ms": 288960,
      "end_ms": 291495,
      "text": "像这样的事儿他一干就是十几年。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ab745923f1d56a7_s00123",
      "start_ms": 292430,
      "end_ms": 294605,
      "text": "这十几年里他经历了什么？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ab745923f1d56a7_s00124",
      "start_ms": 295570,
      "end_ms": 298345,
      "text": "中国人的饭碗到底是怎么端牢的？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ab745923f1d56a7_s00125",
      "start_ms": 298880,
      "end_ms": 301645,
      "text": "点个关注点个赞。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ab745923f1d56a7_s00126",
      "start_ms": 301970,
      "end_ms": 302245,
      "text": "嗯，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ab745923f1d56a7_s00127",
      "start_ms": 302600,
      "end_ms": 303440,
      "text": "收藏起来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ab745923f1d56a7_s00128",
      "start_ms": 303700,
      "end_ms": 305465,
      "text": "转发给身边的亲人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ab745923f1d56a7_s00129",
      "start_ms": 306480,
      "end_ms": 308235,
      "text": "评论区留下一句元老，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ab745923f1d56a7_s00130",
      "start_ms": 309260,
      "end_ms": 316385,
      "text": "我们记得您让更多人知道这五株秧苗背后的故事。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ab745923f1d56a7_s00131",
      "start_ms": 316930,
      "end_ms": 318565,
      "text": "下集我接着讲。"
    }
  ],
